{"id":"a1bd10f9796e9a07","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice.md","title":"ZFC Poset Distributive Lattice","display":"df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice — ZFC Poset Distributive Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice","aliases":["58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice"],"display":"df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice — ZFC Poset Distributive Lattice","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-poset-lattice]]","[[58-df-zfc-order2-infimum]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice — ZFC Poset Distributive Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"79109424a5779d49\" href=\"?note=79109424a5779d49\" title=\"58-df-zfc-poset-lattice\">58-df-zfc-poset-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bad662f9e2c57951\" href=\"?note=bad662f9e2c57951\" title=\"58-df-zfc-order2-infimum\">58-df-zfc-order2-infimum</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,R,m,j\\in V\">\\(L,R,m,j\\in V\\)</span> (lattice carrier, order, meet graph, and join graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in L\">\\(x,y,z\\in L\\)</span> (elements bound in the distributive law)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (sourced predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S(L,R,m,j)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(m,L\\times L,L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,L\\times L,L)\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(m(\\langle x,y\\rangle),\\{x,y\\},L,R)\\land\\langle x,j(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,j(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle\\in R\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,u\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle j(\\langle x,y\\rangle),u\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in L\\;m(\\langle x,j(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)=j(\\langle m(\\langle x,y\\rangle),m(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S(L,R,m,j)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(m,L\\times L,L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,L\\times L,L)\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(m(\\langle x,y\\rangle),\\{x,y\\},L,R)\\land\\langle x,j(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,j(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle\\in R\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,u\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle j(\\langle x,y\\rangle),u\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in L\\;m(\\langle x,j(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)=j(\\langle m(\\langle x,y\\rangle),m(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order is explicit, the operation symbols are total function graphs, and their values are tied to the order before distributivity is asserted.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-poset-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"79109424a5779d49","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-poset-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-order2-infimum","status":"resolved","id":"bad662f9e2c57951","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-order2-infimum]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,R,m,j\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S,\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}poset\\text{-}distributive\\text{-}lattice} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S(L,R,m,j)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcPosetLattice}_S(L,R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(m,L\\times L,L)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,L\\times L,L)\\land\\forall x,y\\in L\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(m(\\langle x,y\\rangle),\\{x,y\\},L,R)\\land\\langle x,j(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,j(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\rangle\\in R\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,u\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle y,u\\rangle\\in R\\to\\langle j(\\langle x,y\\rangle),u\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in L\\;m(\\langle x,j(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)=j(\\langle m(\\langle x,y\\rangle),m(\\langle x,z\\rangle)\\rangle)","display":true}],"bytes":1614,"backlinks":[{"id":"44ab18b3631aa4ec","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetDistributiveLattice}_S$ (distributive-lattice predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice.md|58-df-zfc-poset-distributive-lattice]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","79109424a5779d49","bad662f9e2c57951"]}